                <div style="width:100%;padding:40px;color:#ffffff;">
                    <h5 style="text-align:center;"><br>
Our Mission:</h5>

<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
	The Salvation Army Women's Auxiliary is made up of women who volunteer their time, talent and treasures to raise funds for the work of The Salvation Army throughout Central Alabama.<br>
	&nbsp;
</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
			<div class="my-2"></div>
			<h5 style="text-align:center;">Schedule:</h5>
			<p style="text-align:center;">We meet an average of once a quarter on the Last Wednesday of the assigned month, with night meetings being available upon request.</p>
			<div class="my-2"></div>
			<div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background-image:url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/ba1ae43a-1116-430b-a313-47c06d536cc0_Blue+BG.png');background-position:center center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;" class="text-white rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5">
            <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;"></div>
            <div style="position:relative;z-index:3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;min-height:300px;">
                <div style="width:100%;padding:40px;color:#ffffff;">
                    <h5 style="text-align:center;">Service Opportunities:</h5>

<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
	We engage in 1 major fundraiser a year that enables us to commit to:
</p>

<ul>
	<li>Supplying bedding and linens to the families in our shelter program</li>
	<li>Supplying school supplies to our sheltered children</li>
	<li>Supplying spring break and summer trips for our sheltered families</li>
	<li>Working on the annual Christmas Tree program</li>
</ul>
                </div>
